From: Kai <kayamaguchi@ucsd.edu>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 08:50:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 21/22] D21 (arbiter v3 fix 2, 3; PENDING STUDY): regenerated
 chang0926 configs. A/B/D/R on E (no PE, pos_enc_none_consume_rng), F = E +
 learned PE, C = A07 at 5M, A07-350 descriptive (8 seeds), 56 production;
 pilot-only C-PRIME (A07, current quantizer, 5M) and E1 (E, 1 head, 350k).
 Every config: D20 full-split trace, stored reload check, non-degeneracy block
 with the arm's traced 0-bit floor (static_floors.json via trace_floors.py).
 Seed-block packs {A,B,C,D,F,A07-350} x 8 + R on 2; pilot pack A-s1, A-s2,
 D-s1, A07-350-s1, C-PRIME-s1, E1-s1. nondegenerate_threshold.py for PREFLIGHT

